  <title>Contact hub</title>

  <p>The contact hub opens from a right click on a customer or vendor in most
  lists, such as <link xref="unpaid_invoices"/> or the customer box of an
  invoice. Each button opens another window already showing this
  contact:</p>

  <list>
    <item><p><gui>Edit Contact</gui>: <link xref="contacts#edit"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Contact history</gui>: <link xref="contact_history"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Customer invoices</gui>: <link xref="invoice_history"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Customer payments received</gui>: <link
    xref="payments_received"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Invoice to payment matching</gui>: <link
    xref="invoice_to_payment_matching"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Job sheet history</gui>: <link xref="job_sheet_history"/></p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Vendor purchase orders</gui>: <link xref="vendor_history"/></p></item>
  </list>

</page>
